Meta ad rules:
- Headline: max 40 characters
- Primary text: max 125 characters, hooks in the first line
- Link description: max 30 characters, supports the headline
- CTA text: max 20 characters, action-oriented
- No emojis unless the brand voice allows them
- Make this variant meaningfully different from other angles
- For the social-proof angle: use ONLY the verified stats provided above. If the stats say "not found" or contain PLACEHOLDER markers, keep those markers verbatim in your output so the marketer can replace them with real numbers. Never invent review counts, star ratings, or user numbers.
